    'PNG files need a separate note. PNG is lossless and has no quality setting, which is why a PNG cannot be made much smaller by quality alone. When you give this tool a PNG, it converts it to JPG. For photos and busy screenshots that saves a lot of space. For simple graphics with a few flat colours, PNG is often already the smaller format, and the tool will show you when the result is not smaller so you can keep the original.',
